### List employees
GET http://localhost:3003/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List employees (pagination)
GET http://localhost:3003/api/employees?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List employees (filters + pagination)
GET http://localhost:3003/api/employees?isActive=true&role=EMPLOYEE&page=2&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
